# omf-2097-remastered
===
 One Must Fall 2097, remastered: the 1994 robot fighting classic rebuilt in TypeScript and WebGL2, playing the original game files. HD artwork, widescreen arenas with depth, fight effects, a one-key classic/remastered switch, a training lab, replays, mods and the OMF Studio mod tools. Free, for Windows, macOS, Linux and the browser..
